          'Impaired sulfation (brachymorphic mice, sulfotransferase inhibition) markedly reduces the carcinogenicity — the phase-2 step is required for the harm.',
          'Human urinary metabolite profiles for myristicin, elemicin and safrole are characterised in the forensic toxicology literature, which is how these exposures are detected at all.',
          'Consequence for anyone reasoning about CYP manipulation and allylbenzene-containing material: shifting which CYP route dominates shifts which metabolites form, and the bioactivation route is one of them.',
